00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.865
so they have a roof over their heads?

00:09:25.865 --> 00:09:26.732
And now it's like,

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:29.068
how dare you try to move the homeless?

00:09:29.468 --> 00:09:31.337
This is where they live.

00:09:31.337 --> 00:09:33.172
It's like, again,

00:09:33.172 --> 00:09:34.874
you change the definitions

00:09:34.874 --> 00:09:36.842
and then you say, I'm more conservative.

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:39.445
I believe what I've always believed.

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:40.613
You change these things

00:09:40.613 --> 00:09:41.847
and then you yell at me for it.

